      "title": "Generalstrike Spain Barcelona 11.11.2026",
      "description": "We, the Aeons of Barcelona, ​​have joined the marches to protest against the rising cost of living, low wages, and the difficulties in accessing and maintaining housing. All in a peaceful manner. Many people saw our sign and scanned the QR code; others stopped to ask us about it. Our sign stood out, especially under the artificial lighting and amidst a sea of ​​red and black flags. We realize it’s not much—and it’s still very early days—but we also know that actions like these are important. Little by little, people will come to recognize us. We are convinced that the SPX6900 movement will evolve into a global social and financial alternative. In fact, the process has already begun. THE SYST",
